  "prefLabel": "Env-A 3004.05 Certificate Content",
  "recordType": "rule-section",
  "ruleText": "Env-A 3004.05 Certificate Content. The department shall record on the certificate the total amount of ERCs certified to a generator source, together with any conditions required to ensure that such ERCs remain real, surplus, quantifiable, enforceable, and permanent for the life of the ERC, including conditions enabling the department to continue to verify the reductions in accordance with the verification procedures in Env-A 3004.02.\n\nSource. #6441, EXEMPT, eff 1-21-97",
  "source": "https://github.com/GraniteState/adm-rules-data/blob/1c92d82e0f03a582ca5b7a578588edf38de2318e/raw/2026-11-15/state_agencies/env-a3000.html"
}
